# Lint / security qualification tooling.
#
# CI (tests.yml) previously `pip install`ed ruff, bandit and pip-audit unpinned,
# so an exact-SHA qualification run could silently pick up a new tool release
# (DEP-001). This set is compiled to a full transitive closure so those runs are
# reproducible; bumps happen here and are reviewed like any other dependency
# change.
#
# Constrained to the dev dependency set so shared transitive packages resolve to
# a single version when this file is installed alongside requirements-dev.txt
# (the `test` job) or requirements.txt (the `security` job).
-c requirements-dev.txt

ruff==0.16.6
bandit==1.9.4
pip-audit==2.10.1
